# DS-0026: HEALTHCHECK has no meaning for containers/sankey-export's
# Dockerfile -- it builds a restart_policy: Never CronJob Pod that's
# expected to run once and exit every minute, not stay up as a
# long-running service. Can't be suppressed inline (trivy doesn't
# support inline ignores for checks triggered by an instruction's
# absence, only ones tied to an existing line).
